      "widgets_values": [
        "TRANSPARENT SPRITE EXPORT (128x128)\n\nNo circle mask and no geometric crop.\n\nPipeline: fit with white padding at 64x64 -> nearest upscale to 128x128 -> remove near-white RGB background.\n\nThe three White cutoff nodes default to 0.90. Raise them to preserve more pale sprite pixels; lower them to remove more light-gray background noise. Keep all three values equal.\n\nImportant: genuine white details in the sprite also become transparent. Use a distinct background color if white must be retained.\n\nGodot should provide the fixed icon background behind this exported sprite."
      ],
